01:00:13.940 --> 01:00:17.640
<v Rachel McKibbens>I don't really know how to operate it, I'll be honest. I'm not interested in it.
<v Rachel McKibbens>坦白说，我不知道怎么操作。我不感兴趣。

01:00:17.640 --> 01:00:22.040
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回到《美国生活》带来更多故事。

